OL,3,GNEWSATRNSMT: What's the future for     
OL,4,AScotland's largest music festival?     
OL,6,FWe're just weeks away from Christmas   
OL,7,Fbut for many music fans their thoughts 
OL,8,Fhave already turned to next summer's   
OL,9,Ffestival season.                       
OL,11,FGlastonbury announced its line-up this 
OL,12,Fweek, tickets are on sale for Reading  
OL,13,Fand Leeds and the headliners for       
OL,14,FBelladrum have been announced.         
OL,16,FBut there is silence surrounding the   
OL,17,FTRNSMT plans for next year. Event      
OL,18,Fpromoters DF Concerts has declined to  
OL,19,Fconfirm whether it will return in 2027.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
