OL,3,GNEWSATRNSMT: What's the future for     
OL,4,AScotland's largest music festival?     
OL,6,FNo dates, ticket sales or acts have yet
OL,7,Fbeen announced for the Glasgow Green   
OL,8,Ffestival, which has been running since 
OL,9,F2017.                                  
